@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### List categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalog/categories

### List services (paginated, filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalog/services?page=1&limit=10&sort=price_asc

### Search services by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalog/services?q=konsult

### Single service by id (replace with a real id from the list above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalog/services/srv_095
